{"3156910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sepulchron", "steam_appid": 3156910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sepulchron is a challenging puzzle-horror game set within the abandoned Astor Manor, in which you have 72 in-game hours to escape alive from a deadly curse, inspired by classics like Resident Evil, Secret of Monkey Island and Garry's Mod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/b7b9e96b77c4b3f68d7c24a2cae5d39f.poster.avif?t=1780449092\" width=610 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/b7b9e96b77c4b3f68d7c24a2cae5d39f.webm?t=1780449092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/b7b9e96b77c4b3f68d7c24a2cae5d39f.mp4?t=1780449092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the manor by day, uncover hidden secrets, and solve intricate puzzles that reward logic, observation, and common sense. With a world completely dictated by physics, rather than relying on arbitrary solutions, many obstacles can be overcome by reasoning about how objects should behave. A sword can cut a rope. A heavy object can hold down a switch. The answers are often hiding in plain sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/d0b8e604ab1f2a45599f9268ee0cb1f4.poster.avif?t=1780449092\" width=610 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/d0b8e604ab1f2a45599f9268ee0cb1f4.webm?t=1780449092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/d0b8e604ab1f2a45599f9268ee0cb1f4.mp4?t=1780449092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the manor becomes far more dangerous. Ghosts and other supernatural entities emerge from the darkness, forcing you to fight, flee, or improvise with whatever tools you can find. No night is the same as the one before, making every encounter unpredictable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATMOSPHERE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/5b7a47259ff8826c0ae53b5381dc583a.poster.avif?t=1780449092\" width=610 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/5b7a47259ff8826c0ae53b5381dc583a.webm?t=1780449092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/5b7a47259ff8826c0ae53b5381dc583a.mp4?t=1780449092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sepulchron favors atmosphere over jump scares. Light is safety, darkness is danger, and every resource matters. Explore carefully, manage your time wisely, and remember:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is always more than one way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenging logic-driven puzzles<br>• Dynamic enemies that change tactics and placement each playthrough<br>• Physics-based interactions and problem solving<br>• Atmospheric horror focused on tension rather than jump scares<br>• Resource and time management<br>• Dense exploration packed with secrets and optional discoveries</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sepulchron is a challenging puzzle-horror game set within the abandoned Astor Manor, in which you have 72 in-game hours to escape alive from a deadly curse, inspired by classics like Resident Evil, Secret of Monkey Island and Garry's Mod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/b7b9e96b77c4b3f68d7c24a2cae5d39f.poster.avif?t=1780449092\" width=610 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/b7b9e96b77c4b3f68d7c24a2cae5d39f.webm?t=1780449092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/b7b9e96b77c4b3f68d7c24a2cae5d39f.mp4?t=1780449092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the manor by day, uncover hidden secrets, and solve intricate puzzles that reward logic, observation, and common sense. With a world completely dictated by physics, rather than relying on arbitrary solutions, many obstacles can be overcome by reasoning about how objects should behave. A sword can cut a rope. A heavy object can hold down a switch. The answers are often hiding in plain sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156910/extras/d0b8e6